//// set: fv-f1 — 函数变量的类型是短类链 / 带属性修饰：属性的打印顺序、final 不打、局部、Integer 短类、枚举形参（未做）
//// model: F10
type V = Real(unit = "V");
function f
input V v;
output Real y;
algorithm
y := 2 * v;
end f;
model F10
Real x = f(time);
end F10;
//// model: F11
type V = Real(unit = "V", quantity = "Voltage", min = -10);
function f
input V v;
output V y;
algorithm
y := 2 * v;
end f;
model F11
Real x = f(time);
end F11;
//// model: F12
function f
input Real v(min = 0);
output Real y(unit = "W");
algorithm
y := 2 * v;
end f;
model F12
Real x = f(time);
end F12;
//// model: F13
type V = Real(unit = "V");
function f
input V v[2];
output Real y;
algorithm
y := v[1] + v[2];
end f;
model F13
Real x = f({time, 1});
end F13;
//// model: F14
type V = Real(unit = "V");
function f
input Real v;
output Real y;
protected
V t;
algorithm
t := v;
y := 2 * t;
end f;
model F14
Real x = f(time);
end F14;
//// model: F15
package SI
type Voltage = Real(final quantity = "ElectricPotential", final unit = "V");
end SI;
function f
input SI.Voltage v;
output SI.Voltage y;
algorithm
y := 2 * v;
end f;
model F15
Real x = f(time);
end F15;
//// model: F16
type V = Real(unit = "V");
type V2 = V(min = 0);
function f
input V2 v;
output Real y;
algorithm
y := 2 * v;
end f;
model F16
Real x = f(time);
end F16;
//// model: F17
type I = Integer(min = 0);
function f
input I n;
output Real y;
algorithm
y := 2 * n;
end f;
model F17
Real x = f(3);
end F17;
//// model: F18
type V = Real(unit = "V");
function f
input V v = 3;
output Real y;
algorithm
y := 2 * v;
end f;
model F18
Real x = f();
end F18;
//// model: F19
function f
input Real v(start = 1, fixed = true);
output Real y;
algorithm
y := 2 * v;
end f;
model F19
Real x = f(time);
end F19;
//// model: F110
type E = enumeration(a, b);
function f
input E e;
output Real y;
algorithm
y := if e == E.a then 1 else 2;
end f;
model F110
Real x = f(E.b);
end F110;
//// model: F111
type V = Real(unit = "V");
function f
input V v(min = 0);
output Real y;
algorithm
y := 2 * v;
end f;
model F111
Real x = f(time);
end F111;
